cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this notebook, please cite it as below."
title: "gg -> hh at LO with full top-mass dependence in the SM and the aligned two-Higgs-doublet model"
type: software
version: "1.0"
date-released: 2026-11-05
license: MIT
authors:
  - family-names: Gupta
    given-names: Archana
    affiliation: "Department of Physics, IIT (BHU), Varanasi, India"
repository-code: "https://github.com/archna1212/gg-hh-A2HDM"
abstract: >-
  A self-contained Jupyter notebook that computes pp -> hh through gluon fusion at
  leading order with exact top-quark mass dependence, in the Standard Model and in the
  aligned two-Higgs-doublet model (A2HDM). It includes triangle/box/resonant-heavy-scalar
  decomposition, a constraint filter, SM and A2HDM benchmarks, m_hh and pT distributions,
  and built-in validation checks.
keywords:
  - Higgs pair production
  - gluon fusion
  - aligned two-Higgs-doublet model
  - Higgs self-coupling
  - LHC
